["<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">🔐 Save login for github.com</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">   The agent reached a sign-in page with no saved login for this site.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">   Type the email / username you sign in with (shown), then Enter.</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">   ...</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">   Now the password (hidden). It is encrypted on this machine, bound to</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">   https://github.com, and filled into the page without the model ever seeing it.</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">vault</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">onepassword</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">enabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token boolean important\">false</span><span class=\"token plain\">          </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># opt OUT of a detected manager (default: on when installed)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">account</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\">             </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># `op --account` shorthand; empty = default</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">service_account_token_env</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">bitwarden</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token key atrule\">enabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\" style=\"color:rgb(248, 248, 242)\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token boolean important\">false</span><br></div></code></pre>"]